\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\end{enumerate}
\item[* task:] To let ClosedPREPPPROPs pass the control rules and to turn their 
subject into an object, deleting the CLOSEDPREPPPROP (for VARPREPP).
\item[\ \ strategy:] (also: deviations from accepted proposals)
